#: templates/admin/documentation.php:771
msgid "Security Protocols & Permissions"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:775
msgid "We treat website security as a top priority. My Site Hand implements robust protective policies so that you have total control over what AI agents can query and manipulate on your server."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:780
msgid "1. Hashed Access Tokens"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:782
msgid "All access keys generated inside My Site Hand are immediately hashed using the SHA-256 standard before database storage. Plaintext keys are never stored in your WordPress database, rendering them immune to database leaks."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:787
msgid "2. Granular Capability Scopes"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:789
msgid "You can restrict tokens to specific permission levels:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:792
msgid "Read-Only"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:792
msgid "Allows the agent to read posts, pages, categories, comments, media metadata, and general setup options, but blocks all editing, creating, and deleting capabilities."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:793
msgid "Read-Write"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:793
msgid "Allows standard CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) access to your posts, pages, and products, but prevents the agent from requesting core diagnostics or system error logs."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:794
msgid "Admin Access"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:794
msgid "Unlocks full system features, including error log views, PHP parameters check, and database health fixes."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:799
msgid "3. Immutable Real-Time Audit Log"
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: opening <a> tag link to Audit Log page, 2: closing </a> tag
#: templates/admin/documentation.php:805
#, php-format
msgid "Every single action the AI agent performs is recorded in real-time. Navigate to the %1$sAudit Log page%2$s to view the exact capability requested, parameters sent, calling IP address, and execution duration."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:823
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions & Support"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:828
msgid "Why is the AI unable to connect to my site?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:830
msgid "This is usually caused by loopback routing issues on your hosting or local server configuration. Go to the \"About & Info\" tab and run the \"REST API Loopback\" test to diagnose if your server can make secure outgoing connections to itself."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:835
msgid "Is Node.js required for the plugin to work?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:837
msgid "Yes, if you want to use the automated integration for Claude Desktop via mcp-remote. Node.js is required to execute the connection utility from your local terminal."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:842
msgid "Can I use this plugin with VS Code or other developer editors?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:844
msgid "Absolutely. Any editor or agent client supporting the Model Context Protocol (like VS Code extensions Roo Code or Cline) can load this plugin using the SSE URL provided in the Client Setup tab."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:849
msgid "Does this plugin send my data to external servers?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:851
msgid "No, My Site Hand operates entirely locally on your WordPress host. Your content, logs, products, and configurations are never transmitted to external services, maintaining complete data isolation."
msgstr ""

